WEBVTT

00:05.220 --> 00:09.780
To be dropped in the middle 
of a plain of all places...

00:10.640 --> 00:12.330
It's super hot.

00:14.240 --> 00:16.640
My beautiful skin is going to get sunburned.

00:21.690 --> 00:24.750
Mmm, what a nice breeze.

00:32.890 --> 00:35.430
<i>One participant has been disqualified.</i>

00:35.780 --> 00:38.870
<i>There are 27 participants remaining.</i>

00:38.870 --> 00:39.900
Good.

00:46.940 --> 00:49.190
Desir isn't here.

00:49.540 --> 00:51.820
Doesn't seem to be around here.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.500
I guess we were lucky to be 
transported so close to each other.

00:56.500 --> 00:58.740
You think Desir is okay?

01:01.180 --> 01:02.630
So adorable...!

01:02.630 --> 01:03.710
I mean!

01:05.610 --> 01:06.850
Here I go.

01:18.840 --> 01:20.320
<i>Two are nearby.</i>

01:20.820 --> 01:23.230
<i>And one on the other side.</i>

01:25.040 --> 01:26.990
Let's get the one on the other side!

01:32.700 --> 01:34.110
I found you.

01:39.830 --> 01:44.590
Detection Magic has the downside of revealing 
your location to your opponent.

01:44.590 --> 01:45.880
Didn't you know?

01:45.880 --> 01:48.280
They're beta trash.

01:48.280 --> 01:50.090
Of course they don't.

01:50.870 --> 01:53.050
Trash, huh?

01:53.670 --> 01:57.530
You want to find out which 
one of us is the actual trash?

02:12.860 --> 02:20.030
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

02:22.400 --> 02:29.180
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

02:29.180 --> 02:31.750
<i>A stolen smile</i>

02:31.750 --> 02:41.130
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

02:41.130 --> 02:45.760
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

02:45.760 --> 02:50.180
<i>For the final challenge</i>

02:50.180 --> 02:53.610
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

02:53.610 --> 02:59.810
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:59.810 --> 03:03.150
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

03:03.150 --> 03:10.200
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

03:10.200 --> 03:12.530
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

03:12.530 --> 03:15.170
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

03:15.170 --> 03:20.010
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

03:20.010 --> 03:22.340
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

03:22.340 --> 03:24.970
<i>To my own story</i>

03:28.520 --> 03:31.940
<b></b>Episode Seven

03:28.520 --> 03:31.940
<b> Magical Beasts</b>

03:32.160 --> 03:36.530
We'll teach the beta trash 
about class differences!

03:36.530 --> 03:39.450
You think you can beat us 
because we're in beta?

03:39.450 --> 03:42.280
I wonder where that confidence comes from.

03:44.780 --> 03:46.220
It's not confidence.

03:46.220 --> 03:47.740
It's called certainty—

03:51.160 --> 03:53.500
Oh? As expected of trash.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.760
You seem entirely lacking in manners.

03:55.760 --> 03:56.970
Out of my way!

03:57.630 --> 03:59.240
That didn't work.

03:59.240 --> 04:02.580
Man, I guess he wasn't as weak.

04:03.130 --> 04:04.650
A-Are you okay?

04:04.650 --> 04:05.800
Get a grip.

04:05.800 --> 04:08.430
You think that was enough to take me down?

04:08.430 --> 04:10.030
Be on your guard already.

04:10.030 --> 04:11.020
O-Okay!

04:11.420 --> 04:13.160
Ready, Pram?

04:13.160 --> 04:14.160
Yes!

04:38.320 --> 04:39.500
So fast!

04:39.500 --> 04:40.970
Is he really from beta?

04:43.430 --> 04:45.970
Screw you!

04:49.950 --> 04:53.010
Now! Blast them away with Area Magic!

04:53.010 --> 04:54.400
O-Okay!

04:59.240 --> 05:00.700
I found you.

05:09.240 --> 05:14.190
You bothered to hide yourselves, 
then used magic that revealed your location?

05:14.190 --> 05:15.500
Are you dumb?

05:15.500 --> 05:16.700
You bastard!

05:16.700 --> 05:18.390
You shouldn't get distracted.

05:20.010 --> 05:21.510
Damn it!

05:21.510 --> 05:24.140
Who do you think you're talking to?!

05:25.640 --> 05:27.770
I said, you shouldn't get distracted.

05:29.680 --> 05:31.810
Bye-bye, alpha boy!

05:34.680 --> 05:37.650
Damn you!

05:40.190 --> 05:44.070
If he had targeted me first, 
he might have won.

05:44.070 --> 05:47.540
This is what you get 
for underestimating beta class.

05:47.540 --> 05:49.990
<i>Two participants have been disqualified.</i>

05:49.990 --> 05:52.940
<i>There are 25 participants remaining.</i>

05:54.240 --> 05:55.440
We won!

05:55.440 --> 05:56.780
We sure did.

05:56.780 --> 06:00.630
I just hope the other guys all 
let their guard down like that.

06:00.960 --> 06:04.160
More importantly, you're 
improving a whole lot, Pram!

06:05.230 --> 06:07.980
It's all thanks to Desir!

06:08.350 --> 06:09.990
Oh, that reminds me.

06:11.570 --> 06:13.620
How long are you going to observe?!

06:13.620 --> 06:16.040
I know you're there!

06:19.060 --> 06:20.150
You got me.

06:20.150 --> 06:21.780
Desir!

06:21.780 --> 06:25.220
You were so strong that I got pulled in.

06:25.220 --> 06:27.240
You were watching the whole time?!

06:27.240 --> 06:29.260
So? What did you think?

06:30.780 --> 06:33.110
It was a good fight, Romantica.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.600
Naturally.

06:34.600 --> 06:35.950
Wh-What about me?

06:37.170 --> 06:39.190
You were amazing, Pram.

06:41.510 --> 06:43.760
I had no role to play.

06:45.880 --> 06:47.020
<i>Back then...</i>

06:47.800 --> 06:49.680
Let's get the one on the other side!

06:52.180 --> 06:54.020
Wait, isn't that...?!

06:54.860 --> 06:58.090
<i>I thought I'd become pretty strong.</i>

06:58.090 --> 07:00.730
<i>He so easily inversed that spell.</i>

07:01.020 --> 07:03.360
<i>We're in the same party, but it still annoys me.</i>

07:03.900 --> 07:05.040
Romantica.

07:06.740 --> 07:08.450
You did really well too.

07:08.450 --> 07:09.500
Here's your reward.

07:10.160 --> 07:14.600
There, there, there, there, there.

07:15.560 --> 07:18.220
Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

07:18.220 --> 07:22.600
Well, since you were quiet, I assumed you 
were waiting for me to pat your head, too.

07:22.600 --> 07:24.260
I was <i>not</i>!

07:24.920 --> 07:26.130
Oh, jeez!

07:26.130 --> 07:28.580
Never touch my head again!

08:05.820 --> 08:08.710
It's not that I have 
a personal grudge against you.

08:09.550 --> 08:12.880
If anything, resent your poor luck.

08:14.080 --> 08:16.570
<i>One participant has been disqualified.</i>

08:16.570 --> 08:19.470
<i>There are 18 participants remaining.</i>

08:21.390 --> 08:22.660
Another one.

08:22.660 --> 08:23.890
Yes.

08:23.890 --> 08:25.940
But continue what you were saying.

08:26.470 --> 08:31.410
Right. There are two paths for us 
to get promoted to the alpha class.

08:31.910 --> 08:35.910
First is to finish in first place 
by clearing this Shadow World.

08:38.620 --> 08:43.640
Second is to survive and 
place within the top nine.

08:45.170 --> 08:47.730
Clearing the Shadow World...

08:48.110 --> 08:49.430
You think we can do it?

08:49.430 --> 08:51.080
Not even close.

08:51.080 --> 08:54.250
They would gang up on us 
in the process of clearing it.

08:54.250 --> 08:56.160
They're all alpha, after all.

08:56.480 --> 08:58.390
Of course.

08:58.740 --> 09:01.400
These are all enemies, right?

09:01.400 --> 09:02.350
With that said,

09:04.060 --> 09:06.920
there's a chance for us 
to finish in the final nine.

09:07.620 --> 09:10.150
The other parties will be crashing 
against each other,

09:10.150 --> 09:11.770
so more people will get disqualified.

09:12.580 --> 09:18.200
There are 18 remaining, so if nine 
more get disqualified, we'll win.

09:19.280 --> 09:22.460
See? That's easier than clearing it.

09:22.460 --> 09:23.500
Oh, no, no, no.

09:23.500 --> 09:25.750
I don't think that's as easy as you make it sound!

09:26.210 --> 09:29.550
We'll be okay.

09:47.270 --> 09:48.940
It's pouring down.

09:48.940 --> 09:50.890
Let's get under that tree over there!

09:56.230 --> 09:58.290
It doesn't seem like 
it'll let up anytime soon.

09:58.290 --> 09:59.790
What should we do?

09:59.790 --> 10:02.510
Let's stay here a little longer.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.080
All right.

10:04.080 --> 10:06.210
I guess that's our only option.

10:12.010 --> 10:15.380
<i>Aiming to be in the top nine
 among the alpha students...</i>

10:15.380 --> 10:18.070
<i>The thought wouldn't even cross 
my mind if I was by myself.</i>

10:20.080 --> 10:25.350
<i>What if I had taken Doneta's invitation,
 hiding the truth?</i>

10:25.640 --> 10:30.190
Had I known you were a commoner, 
I wouldn't have invited you to our party.

10:31.440 --> 10:34.160
<i>They'd have found out by now, and...</i>

10:36.570 --> 10:37.680
Romantica.

10:37.680 --> 10:38.580
Huh?

10:39.510 --> 10:41.280
Don't you worry!

10:41.280 --> 10:45.400
You two are truly getting strong,
 I guarantee it.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.550
Yup, yup.

10:51.320 --> 10:54.800
<i>Seriously, you're a weirdo.</i>

10:56.550 --> 10:58.310
Stop touching my head!

10:58.310 --> 10:59.320
Okay.

10:59.320 --> 11:02.340
And I told you I don't like 
that look on your face!

11:02.340 --> 11:03.650
My bad.

11:03.650 --> 11:05.250
I love it!

11:05.250 --> 11:06.800
Thanks.

11:06.800 --> 11:08.330
What the heck?!

11:10.980 --> 11:12.030
<i>This party...</i>

11:13.420 --> 11:14.910
<i>I love them so much!</i>

11:34.600 --> 11:35.870
It's time.

11:35.870 --> 11:37.110
Time for what?

11:37.430 --> 11:38.740
Don't you remember from our studying?

11:38.740 --> 11:41.100
This is the world of the Privius Clock Tower.

11:51.240 --> 11:54.110
<i>The Privius Clock Tower is 
a high-level magical device</i>

11:54.110 --> 11:57.290
<i>that produces monsters at regular intervals.</i>

12:18.650 --> 12:21.190
<i>A survival quest has been generated.</i>

12:21.640 --> 12:24.260
A survival quest?

12:28.520 --> 12:31.850
<i>The clock tower has produced a new monster.</i>

12:32.160 --> 12:33.450
Yeah, yeah.

12:33.450 --> 12:34.570
Focus!

12:34.940 --> 12:37.990
<i>Survive the monster's attack.</i>

12:37.990 --> 12:39.530
A monster?

12:44.610 --> 12:47.000
Oh boy, that's too bad.

12:47.450 --> 12:51.080
Beta class is absolutely finished now.

13:11.860 --> 13:13.190
Wh-What was that?

13:13.910 --> 13:16.170
<i>One participant has been disqualified.</i>

13:16.170 --> 13:18.900
<i>There are 17 participants remaining.</i>

13:18.900 --> 13:20.710
Get back, you two.

13:20.710 --> 13:21.540
Desir!

13:21.540 --> 13:22.380
Hey!

13:23.620 --> 13:26.190
Ugh! What is this smell?!

13:26.190 --> 13:27.320
It stinks!

13:27.680 --> 13:29.620
Hey, what's happening—

13:32.950 --> 13:33.960
It's coming.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.730
You two, be on guard!

13:43.720 --> 13:44.940
R-Rats again?!

13:44.940 --> 13:46.600
Desir!

13:47.850 --> 13:48.620
Whoa!

13:48.620 --> 13:50.290
The monster rat is pissed!

13:50.290 --> 13:52.310
Desir, help us!

13:54.770 --> 13:56.220
That one...

13:56.220 --> 13:57.370
Crap!

13:57.370 --> 13:58.650
Both of you, run!

13:58.650 --> 13:59.680
Huh? Why?

13:59.680 --> 14:00.900
Just hurry!

14:00.900 --> 14:01.710
Okay!

14:01.710 --> 14:03.150
Run! It's a pack of them!

14:10.330 --> 14:11.830
<i>A Kildra mouse.</i>

14:12.480 --> 14:15.410
<i>A monster that uses 
a battalion of mice like limbs.</i>

14:15.410 --> 14:17.350
<i>Its staple diet is human blood.</i>

14:17.350 --> 14:20.020
<i>It never gives up 
once it decides on a target.</i>

14:20.020 --> 14:21.590
<i>The other parties must also be...</i>

14:23.930 --> 14:25.350
Windblow!

14:29.720 --> 14:31.430
It's not working at all!

14:31.750 --> 14:32.580
It's pointless!

14:32.580 --> 14:33.450
Run for now!

14:33.450 --> 14:35.550
But they'll catch up!

14:36.150 --> 14:38.000
A dead end?!

14:38.480 --> 14:40.370
Pram, keep on going!

14:40.370 --> 14:41.310
Okay!

14:43.240 --> 14:44.120
Romantica!

14:44.120 --> 14:47.230
No way, no way, no way...

14:45.200 --> 14:47.230
You're mouse food otherwise!

14:48.260 --> 14:50.330
Okay, fine!

14:53.160 --> 14:54.130
Romantica!

14:55.230 --> 14:56.220
Are you okay?

14:59.630 --> 15:00.990
Run! Hurry!

15:00.990 --> 15:01.910
O-Okay...

15:04.290 --> 15:07.460
What the heck are we supposed to do?!

15:07.460 --> 15:09.720
We have to beat the one in command!

15:09.720 --> 15:11.390
And where is that?

15:11.390 --> 15:12.220
Inside the pack!

15:12.220 --> 15:14.770
That's impossible!

15:14.770 --> 15:16.440
There's a way!

15:16.440 --> 15:17.570
Desir?!

15:17.570 --> 15:18.860
Desir?!

15:21.320 --> 15:24.030
Your favorite... human blood!

15:26.530 --> 15:27.310
There it is!

15:27.310 --> 15:27.950
Romantica!

15:27.950 --> 15:29.250
G-Got it!

15:30.240 --> 15:31.790
Wind Bullet!

15:35.040 --> 15:36.240
Yes!

15:39.290 --> 15:40.590
Are you serious?!

15:40.970 --> 15:42.850
It may not look it, but it is a monster.

15:42.850 --> 15:45.630
Its magical resistance seems to be high.

15:47.270 --> 15:50.260
<i>Even Romantica with her current 
skills can't beat it in one blow.</i>

15:50.260 --> 15:51.220
<i>I have no choice.</i>

15:52.090 --> 15:53.720
Let's retreat and regroup.

15:59.020 --> 15:59.980
Hold on!

15:59.980 --> 16:00.730
Pram?!

16:03.880 --> 16:05.230
Pram!

16:18.050 --> 16:20.190
<i>One participant has been disqualified.</i>

16:21.080 --> 16:23.710
<i>There are 16 participants remaining.</i>

16:28.440 --> 16:30.140
So, this is the monster?

16:30.140 --> 16:31.720
That's bad, no?

16:31.720 --> 16:32.740
Yeah.

16:34.590 --> 16:36.400
You guys, don't move.

16:38.270 --> 16:41.650
Spearburn!

16:52.100 --> 16:54.470
Oh, just a mouse.

16:57.680 --> 16:59.430
Go on, shoo!

17:01.080 --> 17:02.580
Idiot! Look out!

17:14.910 --> 17:16.560
<i>I have to focus.</i>

17:18.490 --> 17:21.040
<i>Desir said there's a commander.</i>

17:21.380 --> 17:22.520
<i>Where is it?</i>

17:23.290 --> 17:25.990
<i>It must have sustained some damage 
from Romantica's spell.</i>

17:28.440 --> 17:30.230
<i>I'm going to find it!</i>

17:38.630 --> 17:39.700
Pram!

17:39.700 --> 17:41.000
Where are you?! Pram!

17:41.510 --> 17:42.950
Should I blast them away with magic?

17:42.950 --> 17:45.420
No! You'll hit Pram, too!

17:45.420 --> 17:48.210
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

17:49.800 --> 17:51.950
Damn it!!

18:03.300 --> 18:06.690
<i>You have succeeded in 
defeating the Kildra mouse.</i>

18:06.690 --> 18:09.480
<i>This concludes the survival quest.</i>

18:11.640 --> 18:12.150
Pram!

18:12.150 --> 18:13.360
Are you okay?

18:14.220 --> 18:15.470
Desir...

18:16.720 --> 18:17.680
Pram!

18:19.070 --> 18:20.740
Thank you, Pram.

18:22.430 --> 18:23.960
I got praised.

18:24.300 --> 18:26.590
Don't push yourself so hard.

18:26.590 --> 18:27.920
Yeah, I shouldn't have.

18:28.230 --> 18:30.670
I think... I'm a bit tired...

18:30.670 --> 18:33.770
Yeah, get plenty of rest.

18:34.550 --> 18:35.920
Okay...

18:35.920 --> 18:38.610
I'll close my eyes for a second...

18:41.820 --> 18:43.290
Is he asleep?

18:43.290 --> 18:44.010
Yeah.

18:52.860 --> 18:54.830
I'm amazed at Pram.

18:54.830 --> 18:57.110
He said he didn't like rats.

18:57.870 --> 18:58.630
Yeah.

18:59.340 --> 19:03.140
Romantica, can you watch Pram for a bit?

19:03.140 --> 19:04.870
What? Um, sure.

19:06.780 --> 19:07.850
Desir?

19:18.920 --> 19:20.790
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

19:21.260 --> 19:24.640
<i>I should've been able to clear it 
without making Pram go through that!</i>

19:25.810 --> 19:29.650
<i>I got carried away by their 
improvement, I let my guard down...</i>

19:30.130 --> 19:31.910
<i>And this is the result?!</i>

19:36.230 --> 19:38.050
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

19:39.190 --> 19:40.510
<i>Don't forget.</i>

19:40.830 --> 19:45.280
<i>I'm here so I won't lose my friends again!</i>

20:02.340 --> 20:04.520
It's not letting up.

20:05.310 --> 20:08.310
Hey! Where have you... been?

20:08.310 --> 20:10.190
What happened to you?

20:10.190 --> 20:11.480
It's nothing.

20:11.480 --> 20:13.150
More importantly, how's Pram?

20:18.890 --> 20:20.410
Hi there, Pram.

20:20.410 --> 20:21.700
We should get going soon.

20:23.450 --> 20:25.410
What happened to your face?!

20:25.410 --> 20:26.560
It's nothing.

20:26.560 --> 20:27.870
You think you can move?

20:27.870 --> 20:28.780
Yes!

20:28.780 --> 20:30.370
I'm okay now!

20:30.370 --> 20:32.320
Good. Let's get going.

20:32.320 --> 20:34.670
Wait, in this rain?!

20:34.670 --> 20:35.570
Yeah.

20:36.260 --> 20:37.690
We finally found it.

20:39.040 --> 20:41.020
That's Privius Clock Tower.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.720
That's...

20:42.720 --> 20:43.880
Let's go!

20:55.870 --> 20:57.890
<i>I'll never make the same mistake again.</i>

20:59.790 --> 21:02.350
<i>I'll take the perfect route to reach my goal.</i>

21:04.700 --> 21:07.450
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:07.450 --> 21:10.160
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:10.160 --> 21:13.770
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

21:18.250 --> 21:23.660
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

21:23.660 --> 21:28.260
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairy tale</i>

21:29.010 --> 21:34.380
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

21:34.380 --> 21:38.810
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

21:39.160 --> 21:45.330
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

21:45.330 --> 21:50.590
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

21:50.590 --> 21:55.620
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

21:55.620 --> 21:59.830
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

22:01.340 --> 22:04.110
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:04.110 --> 22:06.800
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:06.800 --> 22:10.310
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:12.180 --> 22:15.020
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

22:15.020 --> 22:17.600
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

22:17.600 --> 22:20.310
<i>Because this time</i>

22:20.310 --> 22:24.440
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

22:49.760 --> 22:51.770
That's our leader for you!

22:51.770 --> 22:53.710
But that's a bit much, no?

22:58.400 --> 22:59.370
Let's go.

23:11.990 --> 23:13.750
The heck are you doing?

23:14.580 --> 23:15.550
Let's go.

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b></b>Episode Eight

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b> Crash</b>

23:36.030 --> 23:38.470
Next episode, "Crash."
